SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the code and the codebook in this repository.

It does NOT cover, and cannot grant any rights in, the source material the
pipeline reads:

  * Castanet forum comments are the property of their authors and Castanet.
    Castanet's Terms of Use prohibit redistribution. No comment text is
    contained in this repository, and none may be redistributed under this
    licence.

  * City of Kelowna council records are public records published by the
    municipality and are governed by the City's own terms, not this licence.
    Council minutes name identifiable residents who spoke at public hearings;
    those names are not contained in this repository.

Anyone running this pipeline is responsible for their own compliance with the
terms of every source they collect from, and for the privacy obligations that
attach to identifiable individuals in that material.
